  "notes": {
    "chatA": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "A · Front Desk + Lounge (familiar, but better). Clubs and DMs in one inbox. Each club has a Board only officers post on (replies stay quiet), a Lounge where members talk, and room chips for events. Easiest to build.",
      "w": 860,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 6860
    },
    "chatB": {
      "fill": "pink",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "B · Tonight (fresh). Chat is organised by time: live and upcoming event rooms first, each club's Lounge as a Hangout. Rooms open before an event, glow when live, become an album after.",
      "w": 860,
      "x": 1060,
      "y": 6860
    },
    "chatC": {
      "fill": "purple",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "C · The Quad (bold). One named, verified campus conversation lit by the bloom, with your clubs as circles on top. Most 'all together', but needs many clubs and more moderation.",
      "w": 860,
      "x": 2120,
      "y": 6860
    },
    "r2opt1": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "Option 1 · Everything in Messages, three tabs: Chats (DMs + group chats only), Clubs, Events. The RSVP week strip lives on Events. Click the tabs to switch.",
      "w": 1330,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 8324
    },
    "r2opt2": {
      "fill": "pink",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "Option 2 · Club + event chat stays in Campus › Chat. Messages stays DMs + group chats.",
