    "w0club": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "Inside a club, restyled to Option 3. The Lounge is where members talk; the Board is where officers post and replies fold under the post. Room chips: Lounge, Board, Officers, plus one chip per event you're going to. An event chat has Where and When, who's going, and the same + tray. 'Your hat' shows your role in v1 (Owner, Officer, Mod, Member); custom titles come after launch. Tweaks: on the Board switch officer / member; on the event chat switch soon, live, after, closed.",
      "w": 1800,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 9804
    },
    "w0empty": {
      "fill": "green",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "Messages home as it ships in v1 (Requests stays; this week only), and the three empty states for launch, when there are few clubs and events. Each has one next step.",
      "w": 1800,
      "x": 4470,
      "y": 9804
    },
    "w0tray": {
      "fill": "pink",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "The + tray has three things in v1: Poll, Sign-up, Event. Polls show names unless you switch on Anonymous. Sign-ups always show names. The Event card's Going and Maybe are your real RSVP. Press Play on the tray to walk the flow.",
      "w": 2000,
